{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dismissSearch"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19DismissSearchActionV","text":"DismissSearchAction","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this environment value to get the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the current "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Then call the instance to dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current search interaction. You call the instance directly because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it defines a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/callAsFunction()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method that Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls when you call the instance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you dismiss search, SwiftUI:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/isSearching","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clears any text from the search field."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes focus from the search field."}]}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Calling this instance has no effect if the user isn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"interacting with a search field.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this action to dismiss a search operation based on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another user interaction. For example, consider a searchable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Button"},{"type":"text","text":" that presents more information about the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matching item from a collection:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @State private var text = \"\"","","    var body: some View {","        NavigationView {","            SearchResults(searchText: text)","                .searchable(text: $text)","        }","    }","}","","private struct SearchResults: View {","    let searchText: String","","    let items = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]","    var filteredItems: [String] { items.filter { $0 == searchText.lowercased() } }","","    @State private var isPresented = false","","    var body: some View {","        if let item = filteredItems.first {","            Button(\"Details about \\(item)\") {","                isPresented = true","            }","            .sheet(isPresented: $isPresented) {","                NavigationView {","                    DetailView(item: item)","                }","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The button becomes visible only after the user enters search text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that produces a match. When the user taps the button, SwiftUI shows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a sheet that provides more information about the item, including"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an Add button for adding the item to a stored list of items:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    let item: String","","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss","    @Environment(\\.dismissSearch) private var dismissSearch","","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Information about \\(item).\")","            .toolbar {","                Button(\"Add\") {","                    \/\/ Store the item here...","","                    dismiss()","                    dismissSearch()","                }","            }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user can dismiss the sheet by dragging it down, effectively"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"canceling the operation, leaving the in-progress search interaction"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intact. Alternatively, the user can tap the Add button to store the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"item. Because the user is likely to be done with both the detail view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the search interaction at this point, the button’s closure also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property to dismiss the sheet,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the "},{"code":"dismissSearch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property to reset the search field."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismisssearch"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"title":"dismissSearch","symbolKind":"property","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV13dismissSearchAA07DismissG6ActionVvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismissSearch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissSearchAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19DismissSearchActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"An action that ends the current search interaction.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismissSearch"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissSearchAction":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction","role":"symbol","title":"DismissSearchAction","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismisssearchaction","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissSearchAction","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DismissSearchAction","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that can end a search interaction."}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Environment":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Environment","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environment","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Environment","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Environment","kind":"identifier"}]